        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desktop Colony is a cosy, incremental, semi-idle colony simulator designed to sit on top of your desktop allowing you to work on other tasks while growing your space colony!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Asteroid Mining</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send out probes to search for resources to mine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every asteroid increases your resources generated per minute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825610/extras/2af377d8cab80843e1ebae0fe0e3389c.poster.avif?t=1774599652\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825610/extras/2af377d8cab80843e1ebae0fe0e3389c.webm?t=1774599652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825610/extras/2af377d8cab80843e1ebae0fe0e3389c.mp4?t=1774599652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Ships and Structures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build habs to house more colonists and watch the ships fly around your colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825610/extras/118ae889f242bd9611cc69ce5ec2f0b7.poster.avif?t=1774599652\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825610/extras/118ae889f242bd9611cc69ce5ec2f0b7.webm?t=1774599652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825610/extras/118ae889f242bd9611cc69ce5ec2f0b7.mp4?t=1774599652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Research</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research strange artifacts and develop new technologies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825610/extras/25ef912ddbfd5ac2bd970710c92b6ae3.poster.avif?t=1774599652\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825610/extras/25ef912ddbfd5ac2bd970710c92b6ae3.webm?t=1774599652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825610/extras/25ef912ddbfd5ac2bd970710c92b6ae3.mp4?t=1774599652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore and Expand</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new types of asteroids and expand your colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your fledgling settlement from tiny backwater to bustling metropolis.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desktop Colony is a cosy, incremental, semi-idle colony simulator designed to sit on top of your desktop allowing you to work on other tasks while growing your space colony!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Asteroid Mining</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send out probes to search for resources to mine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every asteroid increases your resources generated per minute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825610/extras/2af377d8cab80843e1ebae0fe0e3389c.poster.avif?t=1774599652\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825610/extras/2af377d8cab80843e1ebae0fe0e3389c.webm?t=1774599652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825610/extras/2af377d8cab80843e1ebae0fe0e3389c.mp4?t=1774599652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Ships and Structures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build habs to house more colonists and watch the ships fly around your colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825610/extras/118ae889f242bd9611cc69ce5ec2f0b7.poster.avif?t=1774599652\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825610/extras/118ae889f242bd9611cc69ce5ec2f0b7.webm?t=1774599652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825610/extras/118ae889f242bd9611cc69ce5ec2f0b7.mp4?t=1774599652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Research</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research strange artifacts and develop new technologies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825610/extras/25ef912ddbfd5ac2bd970710c92b6ae3.poster.avif?t=1774599652\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825610/extras/25ef912ddbfd5ac2bd970710c92b6ae3.webm?t=1774599652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825610/extras/25ef912ddbfd5ac2bd970710c92b6ae3.mp4?t=1774599652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore and Expand</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new types of asteroids and expand your colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your fledgling settlement from tiny backwater to bustling metropolis.</p>",
